cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Dietary Creatine Intake and Depression Risk in NHANES 2013-March 2020: a Dose-Response Re-analysis"
authors:
  - family-names: "Piñero Roig"
    given-names: "Laura"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-3390-4029"
    affiliation: "Universitat de Barcelona, Faculty of Medicine"
abstract: >-
  Secondary analysis of NHANES 2013-March 2020 extending Bakian et al.
  2020 on dietary creatine intake and depression risk. Adds a
  dose-response model based on restricted cubic splines and a formal
  interaction test with antidepressant medication use, implemented in
  R with the survey package. Abstract submitted to the 5th IJMS World
  Conference of Medical Student Research, July 2026.
repository-code: "https://github.com/laurapiro17/wcmsr-creatine-nhanes"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - NHANES
  - nutritional epidemiology
  - depression
  - creatine
  - restricted cubic splines
  - survey statistics
  - clinical research
date-released: 2026-04-29
